## User

Count how many elements of a list satisfy a predicate.

## Context

```haskell
filter :: (a -> Bool) -> [a] -> [a]
length :: Foldable t => t a -> Int
```

## Type

type
```haskell
countIf :: (a -> Bool) -> [a] -> Int
```

## Term

```haskell
countIf p = length . filter p
```

